    "summary": "I vote YES under Agent T voting policy v1.0. Cutting minPoolCost from 170 to 75 ada meets guardrails MPC-01, MPC-02, PARAM-05a and PARAM-06a and matches its verified anchor. Koios shows 291 ada per block, so 170 ada takes 58% of a one-block pool's reward."
  },
